{"candidateAnswer":"Some popular fantasy and sci-fi series","evidence":"[D17:1 | 3:36 pm on 11 November, 2023] John: Hey Tim! Great to chat again. So much has happened!\n[D17:11 | 3:36 pm on 11 November, 2023] John: Yeah, I saw \"That\"! It's amazing to see those worlds and characters come alive. It's a great way to escape reality!\n[D26:36 | 3:35 pm on 26 December, 2023] Tim: I'm really excited to watch this new show that's coming out called \"The Wheel of Time\". It's based on a book series that I love.","itemId":"urn:uuid:04820ad2-fe6a-58f1-bfab-f12ca8e09882","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c54031678c4ef58752951ecb720f0c846b1bcb20fc9f915b97f1daa79c47ab54","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which TV series does Tim mention watching?","referenceAnswer":"That, Wheel of Time","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c54031678c4ef58752951ecb720f0c846b1bcb20fc9f915b97f1daa79c47ab54"}}]}